@user1Token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJwYXJlbnRfc2FyYWgiLCJyb2xlIjoiVVNFUiIsImV4cCI6MTgyMzYyMDgzMX0.ke8vm7ntj0fSG1Tud8ZvH5tx0J1PALxY-KHyUZFiN1U
@user2Token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJwYXJlbnRfa2FyaW0iLCJyb2xlIjoiVVNFUiIsImV4cCI6MTgyMzYyMDgzMX0.SK2rurwgALqposBFB3ofouPizDdhsuaWzgne4JID5Xs

### 1. Healthcheck (Liveness)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Readiness Check (MongoDB & RabbitMQ status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
Accept: application/json

### 3. Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### 4. [ADMIN] Création d'un Quartier (Lafayette - Tunis)
# @name createNeighborhood
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/neighborhoods
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lafayette Demo",
  "city": "Tunis",
  "center": {
    "type": "Point",
    "coordinates": [10.1815, 36.8065]
  },
  "boundary": {
    "type": "Polygon",
    "coordinates": [[
      [10.1750, 36.8020],
      [10.1880, 36.8020],
      [10.1880, 36.8120],
      [10.1750, 36.8120],
      [10.1750, 36.8020]
    ]]
  }
}

### 5. Détail d'un Quartier par son ID
@neighborhoodId = {{createNeighborhood.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/neighborhoods/{{neighborhoodId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}

### 6. Trouver un Quartier par des Coordonnées ($geoIntersects)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/neighborhoods/by-point?lng=10.1815&lat=36.8065
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}

### 7. [PARENT 1] Enregistrement de sa Position (Floutage Serveur ~200m)
# Le point exact n'est jamais stocké. Floutage stable par HMAC (anti-moyennage).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lng": 10.1815,
  "lat": 36.8065
}

### 8. [PARENT 2] Enregistrement de sa Position proche de Parent 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{user2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lng": 10.1830,
  "lat": 36.8075
}

### 9. [PARENT 1] Consulter sa Position Floutée
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/locations/me
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}

### 10. [PUBLIC] Recherche des Parents Proches (/nearby avec $geoNear)
# Exclut l'appelant (parent_sarah)
# Anonymisation complète (ni nom, ni coordonnées exactes)
# Distance arrondie à 100m près (anti-triangulation)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/nearby?lng=10.1815&lat=36.8065&radius=2500
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}

### 11. Proximité Directe entre Deux Parents (Haversine)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/users/parent_karim/proximity
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}

### 12. [INTERNAL] Recherche Inter-services (/internal/geo/users-within)
# Utilisé par Marketplace, Babysitting, Events
# X-Internal-Key obligatoire (temps constant)
# Distances EXACTES conservées (non arrondies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/geo/users-within?lng=10.1815&lat=36.8065&radius=3000
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### 13. [INTERNAL] Distance Exacte entre Deux Parents
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/geo/distance?userA=parent_sarah&userB=parent_karim
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### 14. [VERIFICATION] Sarah demande une vérification d'adresse par voisin
# @name requestVerification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/addresses/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "neighbor_validation"
}

### 15. [VERIFICATION] Karim (voisin) valide l'adresse de Sarah
@verificationId = {{requestVerification.response.body.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/addresses/{{verificationId}}/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{user2Token}}

### 16. [CIRCLES] Sarah crée son Cercle de Confiance "close"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/circles
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "close",
  "members": ["parent_karim"]
}

### 17. [CIRCLES] Sarah consulte ses Cercles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/circles
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}

### 18. Points de Rencontre Sûrs d'un Quartier
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/geo/meeting-points?neighborhoodId={{neighborhoodId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user1Token}}
